\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The Lord Jehovah reigns;
\par His throne is built on high,
\par The garments He assumes
\par Are light and majesty:
\par His glories shine with beams so bright,
\par No mortal eye can bear the sight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The thunders of His hand
\par Keep the wide world in awe;
\par His wrath and justice stand
\par To guard His holy law;
\par And where His love resolves to bless,
\par His truth confirms and seals the grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Through all His mighty works
\par Amazing wisdom shines,
\par Confounds the powers of hell,
\par And breaks their dark designs;
\par Strong is His arm, and shall fulfil
\par His great decrees and sovereign will.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. And will this sovereign King
\par Of Glory condescend?
\par And will He write His name
\par My Father and my Friend?
\par I love His name, I love His word,
\par Join all my powers to praise the Lord.
\par                                              Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

